# Privacy Policy

**Effective Date:** January 1, 2025  
**Last Updated:** January 1, 2025

## Introduction

This Privacy Policy describes how Bible Reading App ("we," "our," or "us") collects, uses, and protects your information when you use our mobile application (the "App"). We are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring your personal information is handled responsibly.

## Information We Collect

### Information You Provide
- **Reading Progress Data:** Verses read, reading streaks, daily goals, and completion statistics
- **Personal Preferences:** Theme settings, font size preferences, notification preferences, and reading goals
- **Device Settings:** Language preferences and notification permissions

### Automatically Collected Information
- **Device Information:** Device type, operating system version, and app version
- **Usage Analytics:** App performance data, crash reports, and feature usage statistics (anonymized)
- **Local Storage:** All reading data is stored locally on your device

## How We Use Your Information

We use the collected information to:
- Track your reading progress and maintain reading streaks
- Provide personalized reading reminders and notifications
- Improve app performance and user experience
- Analyze app usage patterns to enhance features
- Provide customer support when requested

## Data Storage and Security

### Local Storage
- All your reading data, progress, and preferences are stored locally on your device
- No reading data is transmitted to external servers
- Data remains on your device and under your control

### Backup and Export
- You can create local backups of your data
- Backup files remain on your device unless you choose to share them
- No automatic cloud backups are created without your consent

### Security Measures
- Data is encrypted when stored on your device
- App follows platform security best practices
- No sensitive personal information is collected

## Third-Party Services

### Analytics and Crash Reporting
We may use third-party services for:
- **Expo Analytics:** Anonymous usage statistics and crash reporting
- **Platform Analytics:** App Store/Google Play basic usage metrics

These services collect only anonymized, aggregated data and do not have access to your personal reading information.

### Push Notifications
- Notification services are used only for reading reminders
- No personal data is transmitted through notification services
- You can disable notifications at any time in the app settings

## Your Rights and Choices

### Data Control
- **Access:** View all your data within the app's settings and progress screens
- **Export:** Create backup files of your reading data
- **Delete:** Reset your data or uninstall the app to remove all information
- **Modify:** Change your preferences and settings at any time

### Notification Preferences
- Enable or disable push notifications
- Customize reminder times and frequency
- Turn off specific types of notifications (daily reminders, streak reminders, etc.)

## Children's Privacy

This app is suitable for users of all ages. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. The app stores only reading progress data locally on the device. If you are a parent or guardian and believe your child has provided personal information, please contact us.

## Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any material changes by:
- Posting the new Privacy Policy within the app
- Updating the "Last Updated" date at the top of this policy
- Providing notification through the app if significant changes are made

Your continued use of the app after any changes indicates your acceptance of the updated Privacy Policy.

## Data Retention

- Reading data is retained locally on your device until you choose to delete it
- You can reset your data at any time through the app settings
- Uninstalling the app will remove all locally stored data
- No data is retained on external servers after app removal

## International Users

This app is designed to work globally. All data processing occurs locally on your device, regardless of your location. No personal data is transferred across international borders.

